  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewal and partnership, African region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Room for cooperation With the phasing out of countries and programmes, room is created little by little for new programmes arising out of the strategic cooperation. From the third year on, a sum will be set aside in our budget for this purpose. Depending on the initiatives and any overlap with our current programme, this sum may be supplemented. Mondiaal FNV envisages that partnership with the Dutch Department for Aid and Trade may result in new opportunities as well</narrative>
  </description>
